@startuml

skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActivityBorderColor black
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor black

|User|
start
:1. Clicks Play Audio;

|System|
:2. Detects current test mode;

if () then ([Full Test Mode])
  :3. Plays audio automatically;
  :4. Disables seek/pause controls;

  |User|
  :5. Listens to audio (no control allowed);

else ([Practice Mode])
  :3. Plays audio with full controls;
  :4. Enables seek/pause/replay;

  |User|
  :5. Controls audio playback freely;
endif

stop

@enduml
